From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ovis-tui <ovis-tui@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:30:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(embed): export the mouse event types the reader
 hands out

reader::Reader yields UiEvent::Mouse(MouseInput), whose types lived in a crate-private module: a program that embeds the reader could receive a mouse event and not name what it holds. They are exported beside UiEvent.
---
 crates/hc-tui/src/app/mod.rs | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/hc-tui/src/app/mod.rs b/crates/hc-tui/src/app/mod.rs
index 946e9ab..2e20865 100644
--- a/crates/hc-tui/src/app/mod.rs
+++ b/crates/hc-tui/src/app/mod.rs
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
-// Modified by Ovis (https://github.com/devswha/ovis): an embedder's first focus request.
+// Modified by Ovis (https://github.com/devswha/ovis): an embedder's first focus request, and the
+// names of the mouse events its reader hands out.
 //! The interactive client: owns inventory, shared layout, pane connections
 //! and the draw scheduler. One owner for all
 //! UI/VT state; the loop awaits input, protocol notifications and
@@ -61,7 +62,7 @@ mod tab_status;
 mod window_title;
 mod word_selection;
 
-pub use input::UiEvent;
+pub use input::{MouseButton, MouseEventKind, MouseInput, UiEvent};
 pub use pane::{OpenAttach, PaneEv, Role, Spec};
 
 use std::future::Future;
